<title>FRANCE: EU barley refund to Alpine states now 20 Ecus.</title>
<headline>EU barley refund to Alpine states now 20 Ecus.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union set a standing refund of 20 Ecus per tonne for barley exports to Switzerland and Liechtenstein, EU officials said.</p>
<p>The refund previously stood at 22 Ecus per tonne.</p>
</text>
